# Pages and routing

- **Data:** Pages and components should use **`apps/web/src/lib/data.ts`** (`getAllPosts`, `getPostBySlug`, etc.). Do not import `astro:content` or `@sanity/client` directly in pages unless you are changing the unified layer itself.
- **Dynamic routes:** Rest segments use `[...slug].astro` for blog posts, team, services, projects, careers, and legal. Blog tags use `[tag].astro` under `blog/tags/`.
- **Layouts:** Prefer existing layouts (e.g. `@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro`) and head composition via `@/components/fundations/head/BaseHead.astro` / `Seo.astro`.
- **Design system:** `src/pages/system/*` are internal pattern pages — not part of the marketing route map in README.
- **No duplicate route logic:** Reuse `getPostStaticPaths`, `getTeamStaticPaths`, etc. from `data.ts` where applicable.
